\newlabel{fig:simplpsd}{{4}{13}{Simplified AVC in closed loop. (a) Steady-state mode-0 spectrum with the module off and on, against the injected disturbance (grey). (b) The same run in the time domain; convergence takes about \SI {2}{s}, set by $\tfrac 12 g_x\,\mathrm {Re}\,\kappa $}{figure.caption.19}{}}
